# Lich's Relic: "When this Equipment enters, you may pay {2}. When you do, for each opponent, destroy up to one target creature or
# planeswalker that player controls." Bot1 pays {2} (the Black Lotus's other two mana), and the reflexive ability (CR 603.12) takes
# a target among the creatures Bot2 controls: Bot1's own Ornithopter is not one of the candidates (refused), Bot2's is, and is
# destroyed. Bot1's Ornithopter survives.

[Bot1 Deck]
Ornithopter
Black Lotus
Lich's Relic
Swamp x4
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Swamp x6
Swamp x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Lich's Relic.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.PayCost
! Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 0
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield = Ornithopter; Lich's Relic
Stack.Count = 0
